23
00:01:20,163 --> 00:01:22,582
You can also use it on the neck and chest.

24
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:28,222
Leave it on for ten to fifteen minutes, then rinse it off gently but thoroughly with

25
00:01:28,222 --> 00:01:28,861
warm water.

26
00:01:28,861 --> 00:01:31,709
Take your time so none of it is left on the skin.

27
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:38,142
Follow with Dynamic Skin Recovery SPF50 or your Dermalogica moisturizer.

28
00:01:38,842 --> 00:01:42,839
Use it once a week, or whenever your skin needs a soothing remedy.

29
00:01:42,839 --> 00:01:47,866
If your skin is reactive, do a small patch test before using it on your whole face.

30
00:01:48,566 --> 00:01:52,328
It comes in fifteen and seventy-five milliliter tubes.

31
00:01:52,328 --> 00:01:57,970
So that's the Dermalogica MultiVitamin Power Recovery Masque: vitamins A, C and E

32
00:01:57,970 --> 00:01:59,990
